{"id":"n71312-1-14","stage":3,"title":"패션 · 服装","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71312-1-14-1","ko":"너는 패션 감각이 참 뛰어나구나.","zh":"你的时尚感真不错啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"패션","meaning":"服装，时装","explanation":"패션：服装，时装。","readings":[{"term":"패션","audio":"/audio/e87c191097f00f5e6c73.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71312","senseId":"1","lemma":"패션","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"패션","audio":"/audio/e87c191097f00f5e6c73.mp3"}},{"text":"감각이","meaning":"感，感知","explanation":"감각：感，感知；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"감각","audio":"/audio/004cb195b4004269b6b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15430","senseId":"2","lemma":"감각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감각이","audio":"/audio/9d5f91aff67724c1b572.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"뛰어나구나.","meaning":"超群，杰出","explanation":"뛰어나다：超群，杰出；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어나다","audio":"/audio/d7b1acf8ccdbda574e71.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14445","senseId":"1","lemma":"뛰어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뛰어나구나","audio":"/audio/c87a6c5548090a119d93.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"e87c191097f00f5e","term":"패션","zh":"服装，时装","audio":"/audio/e87c